  "interpretation": "Within Tampa, quantitative focal frequency has strong previous-year state dependence under persistent recorded presence, but older quantitative history does not add robust information beyond lag-1. This contrasts with the frozen coarse recorded-state analysis, where earlier history added information beyond lag-1. The contrast motivates a state-dimension-dependent memory-horizon hypothesis but does not prove its mechanism because response models and loss functions differ.",
